      <div class="Section3"><a name="_cultural_naming_profiles" id="_cultural_naming_profiles"></a>
        <h1 class="Annex"><b>Annex B</b><br/>(informative)<br/><br/><b>Cultural naming profiles</b></h1>
        <div><a name="_afghan" id="_afghan"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.1 Afghan</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_albanian" id="_albanian"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.2 Albanian</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_arab_muslim" id="_arab_muslim"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.3 Arab-Muslim</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_bangladeshi" id="_bangladeshi"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.4 Bangladeshi</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_bosnian_serbian_croats" id="_bosnian_serbian_croats"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.5 Bosnian, Serbian, Croats</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_brazilian" id="_brazilian"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.6 Brazilian</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_bulgarian" id="_bulgarian"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.7 Bulgarian</p>

</div>
        <div><a name="_chinese" id="_chinese"></a><p class="h2Annex">B.8 Chinese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d2c3d7a8-9220-42e2-8686-7e6a337ae2d3" id="_d2c3d7a8-9220-42e2-8686-7e6a337ae2d3"></a>Chinese personal names are names used by those from mainland China, Hong Kong,
Macau, Taiwan, and the Chinese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_eded642f-a223-47b1-82d2-b6f7e53ba3ab" id="_eded642f-a223-47b1-82d2-b6f7e53ba3ab"></a>Chinese names consist of a
family name (&#x59D3;, x&#xEC;ng), followed by
a given name (&#x540D;, m&#xED;ng).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_afcb874c-da4b-490c-8299-5d8da8d3d392" id="_afcb874c-da4b-490c-8299-5d8da8d3d392"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo19;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo19;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_bafeb3a6-ba32-448d-8a24-ac44f2470f50" id="_bafeb3a6-ba32-448d-8a24-ac44f2470f50"></a>Some people also utilize a &#x201C;courtesy name&#x201D; or &#x201C;style name&#x201D; (&#x5B57;, z&#xEC;),
by which they were known among those outside their
family and closest friends.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_representations" id="_typical_name_representations"></a><p class="h3Annex">B.8.1 Typical name representations</p><div class="example"><a name="_57e7765e-5ce6-4788-85cb-3ea4ea44858f" id="_57e7765e-5ce6-4788-85cb-3ea4ea44858f"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x6587;&#x201D; (Sun Man), the birth name of the founding father
of the Republic of China &#x201C;Sun Yat-sen&#x201D;:</p></div>
